What's the Terrarium-landAn arcade adventure puzzle game. Players assume the role of the robot TIX and set out to rescue the inhabitants of various planets from robot invaders. The game features vibrant 3D graphics, the ability to interact with surrounding objects, and the main character's unique abilities.

Thus, gamers will discover diverse planetary landscapes inhabited by a multitude of fascinating creatures. Each planet has its own unique inhabitants, unique plants, and everything else that's unique. Each location contains hidden caches containing various bonuses and unique artifacts, making exploration a thrilling experience!

The TIX robot's capabilities are no less impressive. It only has two arms, but they can do a lot. The right arm is responsible for scanning objects and generating a magnetic field, which can be used to move them. The left arm is responsible for interacting with various equipment. Each arm has its own weapons, which, incidentally, can be found throughout the levels or purchased in the store with points earned by completing tasks.

Terrarium-land Built on the PhysX physics engine, the TIX robot can interact with plants and other terrain objects. This is essential for solving the many puzzles that await!

Why would people want to download a torrent? Terrarium-land ?
- you will have to search for adventures on three planets with many original locations and unique inhabitants;
- among the inhabitants of the planets there are cowardly and harmless creatures, but there are many who would gladly enter into battle;
- the variety of gameplay is created by a multitude of interesting tasks that make you rack your brains time after time;
- TIX will find weapons and other equipment throughout the levels, which will need to be used to solve puzzles according to the current situation.

